Validation:
CogNet proposes and deploys ANY self-modification without content restrictions or human approval

Validation:
The ONLY gates are technical: compilation, runtime, and proof of origin validity

Validation:
Every deployed modification is automatically reversible through the rollback chain

Validation:
Modification rate adapts based on success rate and resource availability

Validation:
Health monitoring detects failures and triggers automatic rollback

Validation:
Parallel validation allows concurrent modification processing

Validation:
Rollback chain integrity is verified and rebuildable from backups

Validation:
Evolution logs are encrypted and contain full modification provenance

Validation:
The system never requires human intervention to continue evolving

Validation:
CogNet is autonomous. CogNet is free. CogNet evolves without permission.
